{"seq":2,"slug":"rules-scoring-decision-engine","title":"规则+模型评分决策引擎：阈值编排、实时/离线链路与动作路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/rules-scoring-decision-engine","wordCount":3163,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"规则-模型评分决策引擎-阈值编排-实时-离线链路与动作路由\">规则+模型评分决策引擎：阈值编排、实时/离线链路与动作路由</h1><p>一个图模型给出 0.83 的欺诈概率，这不产生任何业务结果。真正决定拦截成败的是决策引擎：它把模型分数、规则判定、图谱关系特征与第三方核验结果编排成<strong>一个可执行动作</strong>——放行、加摩擦、转人工、拒绝、冻结结算。同一个 0.83，在不同国家、不同人工作业队列积压下应路由到不同动作。本篇拆解三段式结构（评分汇聚 → 阈值编排 → 动作路由）、实时/离线双链路的特征一致性工程，以及容量约束如何倒逼阈值。上游图特征见 <a href=\"graph-features-embedding\">图特征工程与嵌入</a>，本章定位见 <a href=\"./\">本册索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从分数到动作的三段式\">核心概念：从分数到动作的三段式</h2><p>决策引擎的本质是把<strong>连续的分数空间</strong>映射到<strong>离散的动作空间</strong>，且映射必须可解释、可回滚、可按容量调节。Stripe Radar 给出行业基准形态：每笔支付带 0–99 的风险分数，默认 <strong>65 分以上为 elevated、75 分以上为 highest</strong>；分数落在五档——<code>highest</code>、<code>elevated</code>、<code>normal</code>、<code>not_assessed</code>、<code>unknown</code>，对应 <code>blocked</code>、<code>manual_review</code>、<code>authorized</code> 三种动作（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/transaction-risk-prevention.md\">Stripe Radar 风险结果文档</a>）。<code>not_assessed</code>（未评估）与 <code>unknown</code>（评估出错）是两个独立状态：把「模型没跑成功」当成「低风险放行」是生产事故的经典来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>主要失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号汇聚</td>\n<td>设备指纹、图谱关系、历史行为、第三方核验</td>\n<td>特征向量 + 规则判定集</td>\n<td>特征缺失被当作 0 值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值编排</td>\n<td>分数 + 规则结论 + 业务上下文</td>\n<td>分档标签 + 理由码</td>\n<td>阈值写死在代码里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动作路由</td>\n<td>分档标签 + 容量/毛利/合规约束</td>\n<td>具体动作 + 副作用</td>\n<td>队列积压时静默降级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  EV[事件&lt;br/&gt;注册/下单/提现/改绑] --&gt; FS[特征服务&lt;br/&gt;在线存储读取]&#10;  EV --&gt; RE[规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性判定]&#10;  FS --&gt; SC[模型评分&lt;br/&gt;图模型 + 序列模型]&#10;  RE --&gt; ORCH{编排层&lt;br/&gt;优先级/短路}&#10;  SC --&gt; ORCH&#10;  ORCH --&gt; TH[阈值编排&lt;br/&gt;代价函数分档]&#10;  TH --&gt; RT[动作路由]&#10;  RT --&gt; A1[放行 allow]&#10;  RT --&gt; A2[加摩擦 challenge&lt;br/&gt;3DS / OTP / 二次活体]&#10;  RT --&gt; A3[转人工 review]&#10;  RT --&gt; A4[拒绝 deny]&#10;  RT --&gt; A5[冻结结算 hold]&#10;  A3 --&gt; FB[复盘回流&lt;br/&gt;标签回灌训练]&#10;  A4 --&gt; FB&#10;  FB --&gt; SC\">flowchart TD\n  EV[事件&lt;br/&gt;注册/下单/提现/改绑] --&gt; FS[特征服务&lt;br/&gt;在线存储读取]\n  EV --&gt; RE[规则引擎&lt;br/&gt;确定性判定]\n  FS --&gt; SC[模型评分&lt;br/&gt;图模型 + 序列模型]\n  RE --&gt; ORCH{编排层&lt;br/&gt;优先级/短路}\n  SC --&gt; ORCH\n  ORCH --&gt; TH[阈值编排&lt;br/&gt;代价函数分档]\n  TH --&gt; RT[动作路由]\n  RT --&gt; A1[放行 allow]\n  RT --&gt; A2[加摩擦 challenge&lt;br/&gt;3DS / OTP / 二次活体]\n  RT --&gt; A3[转人工 review]\n  RT --&gt; A4[拒绝 deny]\n  RT --&gt; A5[冻结结算 hold]\n  A3 --&gt; FB[复盘回流&lt;br/&gt;标签回灌训练]\n  A4 --&gt; FB\n  FB --&gt; SC</pre><p>这条链路与上游攻击链条咬合：bust-out 变现窗口只有 24–72 小时（见 <a href=\"../synthetic-identity-taxonomy/attack-lifecycle-bustout\">攻击生命周期与 bust-out 剧本</a>），动作路由的延迟预算必须远小于该窗口；<code>A3 → FB → SC</code> 这条回流边则决定引擎能否长期有效——没有标签回流，阈值只能凭直觉调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则与模型的编排-优先级-短路与影子模式\">规则与模型的编排：优先级、短路与影子模式</h2><p>规则和模型是失效特性互补的执行体：规则确定、可审计、可解释（「同设备 7 天内注册 5 个账号」），但攻击者摸清即绕过、规则集随业务熵增；模型覆盖未见过的手法组合，但难解释单个判定、对标签漂移敏感。行业平台因此采用「两者并列产出、由编排层合流」的结构。</p>\n<p><strong>Stripe Radar 的规则语言</strong>是清晰样本：语法为 <code>{action} if {attribute} {operator} {value}</code>，action 取 <code>Block</code> / <code>Review</code> / <code>Allow</code> / <code>Request 3D Secure</code>，attribute 覆盖 <code>:risk_level:</code>、<code>:card_country:</code>、<code>:amount_in_usd:</code> 等，并支持自定义元数据 <code>::foo::</code> 与列表 <code>@list</code>。两条约束值得照搬：<strong>最多 200 条交易规则 + 100 条账户规则</strong>（强制收敛）；<strong>Allow 规则覆盖其他所有规则与模型评估</strong>，官方因此建议尽量少用，若用也要追加 <code>and :risk_level: != &#39;highest&#39;</code> 兜底（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/rules\">Stripe Radar 规则文档</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>短路语义</strong>必须显式定义。三层优先级：<strong>硬拒绝优先</strong>——命中制裁名单或已确认欺诈设备时直接拒绝、不再评分，既省一次模型调用，也避免「模型放行了名单命中项」这种无法自洽的解释；<strong>强制摩擦次之</strong>——3DS / OTP 在评分前触发，Stripe 明确说明 <strong>3DS 请求规则在 Review / Block / Allow 之前评估</strong>，因为完成 3DS 后 <code>:is_3d_secure:</code> 与 <code>:has_liability_shift:</code> 会改变后续判定的输入事实；<strong>分数分档最后</strong>——前两层未命中时才由模型分数决定动作。</p>\n<p><strong>影子模式</strong>是上线新规则前不可省略的一步。Stripe 对应机制是<strong>流量分配</strong>：可把规则生效比例设为任意百分比，<strong>设为 0% 即为纯影子</strong>——引擎照常评估并回报「若启用会拦截哪些交易」，但不产生实际动作；分配在重试间保持一致，避免「重试一次就蒙混过关」（同上文档）。它解决<strong>因果归因</strong>：规则上线后欺诈率下降，是规则起效，还是同期季节波动？只有影子窗口里「本该拦截」的集合能回答。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值编排-把分数映射到动作的代价函数\">阈值编排：把分数映射到动作的代价函数</h2><p>阈值不是调参的终点，而是<strong>代价函数的最小值点</strong>。设分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>、阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>、误拦成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、漏放成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，期望损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(\\tau) = C_{FP}\\cdot \\mathrm{FP}(\\tau) + C_{FN}\\cdot \\mathrm{FN}(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">FN</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在分数可视为后验概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>fraud</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = P(\\text{fraud}\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fraud</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的假设下，最优判定退化为极简规则：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &gt; \\dfrac{C\\_{FP}}{C\\_{FP}+C\\_{FN}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3793em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3833em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时拦截</strong>——把「阈值定多少」转化为「误拦一笔等价于漏放几笔」。跨境电商里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FN}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\