9em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>拒绝 / 冻结结算</td>\n<td>误拦高价值客户的流失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>容量约束是隐含的第四维</strong>。人工队列每期能处理 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 单，总交易量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、欺诈率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、召回率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 时入队案件数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mtext>Precision</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">pTR/\\text{Precision}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">pT</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span></span></span></span></span>，故须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>C</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision} \\ge \\dfrac{pTR}{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">pT</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这给出反直觉结论：<strong>队列容量固定的团队里，提高召回率最终只能靠提高精确率实现</strong>——加进来的案件若是噪声，复核员看十单只有一单是真的，就会开始一律放行，实际召回率反而崩塌。</p>\n<p><strong>理由码</strong>是阈值编排的另一半产物。若决策影响信贷类准入，美国 <strong>Regulation B（ECOA）§1002.9 要求给出具体拒绝理由</strong>，释义指出「披露超过四条理由不太可能有用」，且<strong>评分与人工判断混合</strong>的系统若因「灰区」复核后被拒，须同时给出两个组成部分的理由（<a href=\"https://www.consumerfinance.gov/rules-policy/regulations/1002/interp-9/\">CFPB §1002.9 释义</a>）。图模型天然吃亏——GNN 判定来自邻域聚合。解法是给高风险节点附<strong>局部子图解释</strong>：GNNExplainer 通过最大化「预测与候选子图结构分布」的互信息，为单次预测返回紧凑子图加少量关键特征（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1903.03894\">arXiv:1903.03894</a>），把「此账号与 3 个已确认 bust-out 账号共享设备指纹」变成可写进理由码的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实时链路-vs-离线链路-双通道架构与特征一致性\">实时链路 vs 离线链路：双通道架构与特征一致性</h2><p><strong>实时链路</strong>由同步 API 触发，延迟预算只有毫秒到百毫秒，只读在线存储中的预计算特征与请求内字段，落点是 allow / challenge / deny。<strong>离线链路</strong>按分钟级到日级批任务运行，可跑深层 GNN、全量图重算与阈值回测，落点是 review 派单、hold、批量冻结与调参；它的滞后代价是变现窗口已过，实时链路的超时代价则是用户流失或放行风险。</p>\n<p>两条链路必须共享<strong>同一份特征定义</strong>，否则出现训练—服务偏斜：离线算出的「7 天设备关联账号数」与在线不一致，模型在生产中看到与训练分布不同的输入。Feast 这类特征存储的显式目标正是保证训练与推理特征一致——用离线存储（Snowflake / BigQuery / Spark）<code>get_historical_features</code> 构造训练集，用在线存储（Redis / DynamoDB / Cassandra）<code>get_online_features</code> 提供低延迟读取（<a href=\"https://www.feast.dev/\">Feast 官网</a>）。两条不可妥协的规则：<strong>同一特征只有一份计算逻辑</strong>，在线服务不得用 Python 重写一遍离线 SQL；<strong>时间点正确性</strong>——特征只能用到该事件<strong>之前</strong>已落库的值，图特征尤其危险，若离线重算图时用了事件之后的边，模型会学到未来信息，离线 AUC 虚高、上线即崩。</p>\n<p><strong>降级策略</strong>必须预先设计：fail-closed（拒绝或转人工，适合高客单）、fail-open + 事后补判（先放行、写异步队列，离线重判并触发 hold，适合低客单）、降级到规则子集。Stripe 分档里的 <code>unknown</code> 正是这类分支的显式出口。而<strong>离线链路承担实时链路做不到的事</strong>：社区归属与中心性必须每日离线重算（见 <a href=\"graph-features-embedding\">图特征工程与嵌入</a> 的 Louvain/Leiden 部分）再写回在线存储——<strong>图特征的实时性本质上由离线重算频率决定</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动作路由-摩擦分层-队列管理与申诉闭环\">动作路由：摩擦分层、队列管理与申诉闭环</h2><p><strong>摩擦分层</strong>是最有效的降损杠杆，它把「拒绝」这个二元动作拆成可观测的中间态。Stripe 对 3DS 的处理给出成熟框架：3DS 认证成功的支付，其欺诈拒付责任通常从商户转移到发卡行（liability shift），但 3DS 会降低转化率；因此建议把 <code>Request 3DS</code> 与 <code>Block</code> 规则按风险偏好对齐，同时不拦截不支持 3DS 的钱包——官方示例还显式豁免 <code>:has_cryptogram:</code>（钱包加密凭证）与 <code>:is_off_session:</code>（免密续订）。这说明<strong>摩擦分层必须给「已通过其他机制充分认证」的流量留豁免通道</strong>，否则会系统性伤害复购客户（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/radar/rules\">Stripe Radar 规则文档</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>队列管理</strong>的核心指标是每档<strong>通过率与拦截率的时间序列</strong>，而非单点数值。Stripe 的判据可直接照搬：Review 规则复核<strong>通过率过低</strong>说明规则过宽应收紧、通过率过高说明规则无价值应删除；Block 规则<strong>拦截量上升但欺诈量未降</strong>则很可能在误伤正常用户；<strong>匹配量为零</strong>的规则直接删除。平台还会输出<strong>估算误拦率</strong>——<strong>没有误拦估计的拦截指标不可用</strong>，它无法回答「这条规则净赚还是净亏」。</p>\n<p><strong>策略版本化与可回滚</strong>是审计前提：规则集、阈值、模型版本、动作映射必须以<strong>不可变版本</strong>发布，每次评估记录版本号与特征快照。Alloy 把这一层建模为 workflow/journey，其 portfolio 重跑<strong>保持原 workflow 版本与 as-of 时间不变</strong>，正是做「同策略跨时间对比」的能力（<a href=\"https://developer.alloy.com/\">Alloy 开发者文档</a>）。<strong>申诉闭环</strong>最易被漏掉：申诉一旦成立，必须同时修正该客户的图节点标签、触发该判定的规则/特征、以及<strong>共享同一批特征的其他案件</strong>，因为图模型判定天然是群体性的；引擎须为此输出理由码、命中规则、邻域证据与策略版本，流程留痕归 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规</a>。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还多一层<strong>身份核验分级</strong>约束。NIST SP 800-63A 把身份保证分三级：IAL1 仅自断言、不做核验；IAL2 需证据支持身份真实存在并绑定到申请人（如「两份 STRONG」）；IAL3 要求<strong>物理在场</strong>，绑定核验为 SUPERIOR 强度（生物特征比对），并使用 SP 800-53 High 基线控制（<a href=\"https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-3/sp800-63a.html\">NIST SP 800-63A</a>，2017-06 版；已于 <strong>2025-08-01 被 NIST SP 800-63-4 取代</strong>）。<strong>不同 IAL 等级的账户不应用同一套阈值</strong>：IAL3 已核验账户应更宽松，纯 IAL1 自断言账户在高金额动作上应默认加摩擦。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>三段式结构</strong>：信号汇聚 → 阈值编排 → 动作路由。「特征缺失当 0 值」与「评估失败当低风险」是最高频的两类事故，<code>unknown</code> 必须路由到保守分支。</li>\n<li><strong>规则与模型互补编排</strong>：短路优先级为「硬拒绝 → 强制摩擦 → 分数分档」，用配额（200/100）强制收敛规则集；Allow 类规则覆盖一切，须尽量少用；影子模式（0% 流量分配）是新规则上线的因果归因前提。</li>\n<li><strong>阈值是代价函数的最小值点</strong>：二分类最优阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{FP}/(C_{FP}+C_{FN})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；多档阈值把动作扩展为「放行 / 加摩擦 / 人工 / 拒绝」；容量约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Precision</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Precision} \\ge pTR/C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Precision</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">pT</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 说明固定队列规模下提高召回只能靠提高精确率。</li>\n<li><strong>双链路共享一份特征定义</strong>：实时链路只读预计算特征、受毫秒级预算约束；离线链路承担图社区重算与阈值回测。训练—服务偏斜与时间点泄漏是最危险的隐性缺陷。</li>\n<li><strong>动作路由是产品决策</strong>：摩擦分层与豁免通道、队列指标的时序判据、带误拦估计的净收益评估构成可运营的策略面；NIST IAL1/2/3 是跨境调档的合规依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下游衔接：申诉与人工复核流程见 <a href=\"../investigation-ops-compliance/\">调查运营与合规</a>，上游图特征构造见 <a href=\"graph-features-embedding\">图特征工程与嵌入</a>，身份链接置信度传播见 <a href=\"../identity-graph-resolution/entity-resolution-linking\">实体解析与身份链接</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规则+模型评分决策引擎：阈值编排、实时/离线链路与动作路由","id":"规则-模型评分决策引擎-阈值编排-实时-离线链路与动作路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从分数到动作的三段式","id":"核心概念-从分数到动作的三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"规则与模型的编排：优先级、短路与影子模式","id":"规则与模型的编排-优先级-短路与影子模式"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值编排：把分数映射到动作的代价函数","id":"阈值编排-把分数映射到动作的代价函数"},{"level":2,"text":"实时链路 vs 离线链路：双通道架构与特征一致性","id":"实时链路-vs-离线链路-双通道架构与特征一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"动作路由：摩擦分层、队列管理与申诉闭环","id":"动作路由-摩擦分层-队列管理与申诉闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图特征工程与嵌入：社区发现、中心性度量与 GNN 表征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/graph-features-embedding"},"next":{"title":"模型评估与对抗漂移：标签稀缺、precision@k 与 evasion 防范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/graph-fraud-detection-ml/model-evaluation-adversarial"}}